WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.125
The rest of the gaps are
about identity and scope.

2
00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:07.635
The sample jobs name no environment,
so the token's subject changes with

3
00:00:07.635 --> 00:00:12.450
the branch or event, and a federated
credential matches one subject exactly.

4
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.625
The pipeline runs in a named
environment, so the subject is fixed.

5
00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:19.816
The samples stop right
after signing in to Azure:

6
00:00:19.816 --> 00:00:22.687
no Graph token, nothing
on the higher clouds.

7
00:00:22.687 --> 00:00:24.913
They don't stop two runs overlapping.

8
00:00:24.913 --> 00:00:26.988
And after sign-in there's nothing at all.

9
00:00:26.988 --> 00:00:30.401
The verdict: use Learn's
sign-in exactly as published,

10
00:00:30.401 --> 00:00:33.860
pin it, schedule it, and put
everything else behind it.
